The '''Submerged Island''' is an [[Locations|island]] in the [[Third Sea]]. 

==Appearance==
From the entrance the Submerged Island, there is a large archway with a greyish, abandoned appearance, similar to the other colonial structures. There are corals of different colors in various parts of the island. In the center, a coral flower with buildings fused with coral and gigantic clams appears. The left side of the island contains a small abandoned dock area, with many barrels and boxes scattered along the floors. A large coral covered mountain also sits on the left side of the island, with a small cave on the bottom of it connecting the suspended dock area to the outside dock. There are multiple broken archway-type structures scattered in the sea around the island.

==Location==
The Submerged Island is located under the [[Water|sea]] of the [[Tiki Outpost]], accessible by talking to the [[Submarine Worker]], who is located inside Sub Port 01, near the second dock area at [[Tiki Outpost]]. (Must have defeated the [[Tyrant of the Skies]] raid boss to gain access.)

